  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bellamkonda Anil vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 20 March, 2024 Author: K. Sreenivasa Reddy Bench: K Sreenivasa Reddy APHC010137772024 IN THE HIGH COURT OF ANDHRA PRADESH [ 3327 ] AT AMARAVATI (Special Original Jurisdiction) WEDNESDAY ,THE TWENTIETH DAY OF MARCH TWO THOUSAND AND TWENTY FOUR PRESENT THE HONOURABLE SRI JUSTICE K SREENIVASA REDDY CRIMINAL PETITION NO: 1940/2024 Between: Bellamkonda Anil ...PETITIONER/ACCUSED AND The State Of Andhra ...RESPONDENT/COMPLAINANT(S) Pradesh and Others Counsel for the Petitioner/accused: 1. RAJA REDDY KONETI Counsel for the Respondent/complainant(S): 1. PUBLIC PROSECUTOR (AP) The Court made the following: 2 HON'BLE SRI JUSTICE K. SREENIVASA REDDY Criminal Petition No.1940 of 2024 Order: This Criminal Petition, under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973, is filed by the petitioner herein/A-3, to quash the proceedings in C.C.No.260 of 2019 on the file of the learned II Additional Junior Civil Judge, Sattenapalli, registered for the offences under Sections 420, 273, 270 IPC and Sections 56, 57(1) and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. Bellamkonda Anil vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 20 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/101078565/ 1",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that this is a covered matter and earlier this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs and charge sheets registered for the similar offences based on identical facts and thereby prayed to quash the charge sheet in this Criminal Petition also."
  },
